ortion of `Content-Type` in `parseBody()` before checking form content types.\r\n* Add regression tests for mixed-case JSON and URL-encoded form media types.\r\n\r\n### Why\r\n\r\n`Content-Type` media types are case-insensitive, but mixed-case values such as `Application/JSON` and `Application/X-WWW-Form-Urlencoded` were skipped by `validator()` and `parseBody()`.\r\n\r\nFixes #5060.\r\n\r\n### Tests\r\n\r\n- `bunx vitest --run src/utils/body.test.ts src/validator/validator.test.ts`\r\n- `bun run test`\r\n- `bun run lint`\r\n\r\n### The author should do the following, if applicable\r\n\r\n- [x] Add tests\r\n- [x] Run tests\r\n- [x] `bun run format:fix && bun run lint:fix` to format the code\r\n- [ ] Add [TSDoc](https://tsdoc.org/)/[JSDoc](https://jsdoc.app/about-getting-started) to document the code\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-30T13:25:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T23:31:41Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T23:31:40Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ram-blip:fix-content-type-media-type-case","ref":"fix-content-type-media-type-case","repo":{"id":1285024065,"node_id":"R_kgDOTJfpQQ","name":"hono","full_name":"Ram-blip/hono","owner":{"login":"Ram-blip","id":78085456,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDg1NDU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78085456?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip","html_url":"https://github.com/Ram-blip","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ram-blip/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/